AI Development OS (ADO)

Master Vision, Architecture, Roadmap & Implementation Plan v3.0

⸻

Vision

AI Development OS is not an AI dashboard.

It is a complete operating system for software development where humans and AI collaborate to plan, build, review, deploy, monitor and continuously improve software across unlimited repositories and projects.

The system should become the central operating system for every future game, app, website and business.

Goals:

* Unlimited repositories
* Unlimited projects
* Unlimited AI agents
* Local-first
* Cloud-ready
* Vendor independent
* Event-driven
* Self-learning
* Beautiful UX
* Enterprise architecture from day one

⸻

