2. Event Driven

Everything becomes an event.

Never tightly couple systems.

Every module communicates through an Event Bus.

Benefits

* Fault tolerance
* Easy scaling
* Replay history
* Monitoring
* Analytics
* Independent workers

⸻

3. Plugin First

Nothing is hardcoded.

Everything is replaceable.

Plugins include

* GitHub
* Claude
* GPT
* Gemini
* Ollama
* Docker
* Expo
* Unity
* Steam
* Apple
* Google Play
* Supabase
* Netlify
* AWS
* Slack
* Discord
* Figma

⸻

4. Vendor Independence

The platform should never depend on one AI provider.

Every AI connects through a universal runtime.

⸻

5. Knowledge First

Every action increases knowledge.

Nothing should disappear.

Everything becomes searchable.

